# Not a plugin — just a file ../../install.sh can drop into a repo or your home config.
# See ../adversarial-review/install.manifest for the verb reference.

name   CLAUDE.local.md
about  A starter CLAUDE.local.md — personal notes for Claude, kept out of git.

personal  CLAUDE.local.md  CLAUDE.local.md  your notes for Claude, never committed

tip  @BASE@/CLAUDE.local.md is yours now — open it and write what Claude keeps getting wrong
tip  if it isn't picked up, add a line `@CLAUDE.local.md` to the CLAUDE.md beside it

note  your CLAUDE.local.md was left alone — delete it yourself if you want it gone
